<p>1884 Mandan Pioneer Ad In 1883 he relocated to Mandan after purchasing a lumber yard from the three Hager brothers Frederick, Robert, and Joseph (who had completed construction of the InterOcean Hotel on Main St in Mandan). The following year, William was joined by his brother Albert.By 1906, both would also be associated with W.B. Haight in the lumber and machinery business.</p>

